ons of all of this, you will become a illuminated soul.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845940/extras/aeb78ac9ceca5f7b9ff3ddbc0c43a383.poster.avif?t=1766168949\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845940/extras/aeb78ac9ceca5f7b9ff3ddbc0c43a383.webm?t=1766168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845940/extras/aeb78ac9ceca5f7b9ff3ddbc0c43a383.mp4?t=1766168949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The natural deterioration of the universe must be fought by the illuminated. Entropy is always present everywhere, so we have to be the ones who chose order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a lot of places to discover while traveling the path. Perhaps you could dig out some information out of your past too...? The hidden secrets in these lands are key to understand this world. You will have to hunt them down to discover what really happened! But most importantly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845940/extras/7292007c1099eb06ec3775beab384206.poster.avif?t=1766168949\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845940/extras/7292007c1099eb06ec3775beab384206.webm?t=1766168949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845940/extras/7292007c1099eb06ec3775beab384206.mp4?t=1766168949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class